// note: Product filters Sales and the both-directions Sales -> Customer relationship carries it on to Customer: customer rows reached per brand (the blank brand from a NULL brand and from unknown products included), against the distinct counts that do and do not count the blank key
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS(
    Product[Brand],
    "Lines", [Lines],
    "Customer Rows", COUNTROWS(Customer),
    "Customer Keys", COUNTROWS(VALUES(Customer[CustomerKey])),
    "Customers", [Customers],
    "Customers No Blank", [Customers No Blank],
    "Avg Per Customer", [Avg Per Customer]
)
ORDER BY Product[Brand]
